Upstream work
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Better Connections is a derivative work (a Fabric-to-NeoForge port, with
additional block/tag compatibility) of:

    BetterWalls
    by Lemonnik6484 (Lemonnik) and JX_Snack
    Source:    https://github.com/Lemon4ik6484/BetterWalls
    Modrinth:  https://modrinth.com/mod/betterwalls
    CurseForge: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-walls

The port was first created in July 2026 from the then-current BetterWalls
source. The exact upstream commit was not recorded at the time; it should be
pinned here when identified.

